OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after police car
OL,4,Arammed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man has been charged
OL,7,Fafter a police car was rammed by
OL,8,Fanother car in Londonderry on Thursday.
OL,10,FIt happened in the Rossnagalliagh Park
OL,11,Farea.
OL,13,FThe man has been charged with a number
OL,14,Fof offences including dangerous
OL,15,Fdriving, driving without a driving
OL,16,Flicence, using a motor vehicle without
OL,17,Finsurance, attempted grievous bodily
OL,18,Fharm with intent and possession of a
OL,19,FClass A drug.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
